+
+Per-test timing is armed for every captured run by default; `--no-time` is the
explicit opt-out and
+must remove even an inherited formatter path. Every capture also writes a recor
ded, never-gated
+load witness at suite start and end. The witness keeps the box-free reading and
 return code,
+lifetime-average top processes including excluded tenants, a second-frame three
-second `top`
+sample, and the full one-minute load-average line as separately labelled eviden
ce.
