+<!-- ARM: timing is ON by default -- a run without flags writes a .times file b
eside the log -->
+<!-- ARM: --no-time turns timing off and unsets an INHERITED CAPTURE_RUN_TIMES
-->
+<!-- ARM: a blind box-free result is recorded and never gates the wrapped comma
nd -->
